plugin-db-qualification (2026110602) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The rpi5 zynthian-vangelis set measured again by plugin-qualify 0.19:
    1863 records, every LV2 plugin also run under omx-clap-host's LV2
    adapter on a private JACK server (0 adapter runs owed), then the
    isolated, pool and memory steps and a rejudge. Six bundles whose
    directory name holds a space are not in the set: the sync cannot read
    their files yet.
  * Renamed from omx-qualification-records: the repository and the packages
    are the qualification layer of plugin-db, plugin-db-qualification and
    plugin-db-qualification-<host class>-<set>. The install path stays
    /usr/share/omx/qualification/<host class>/<set>/.
  * One current set per machine class, measured by the latest plugin-qualify:
    the Fedora 44 x86-64 set (plugin-qualify 0.18.5) is dropped and ships
    again when it is measured with 0.19.
  * Depends on plugin-qualify >= 0.19.0 and < 0.20.

